# Review: SamplePlugin

The type, settings, three operations, app-graph extensions, surfaces and companions are in place.
`plugin.test.ts` invokes all three operations through the composer harness. Four presentational
components have stories. The biggest divergence is creation: the root "Create Sample Item" action is
commented out in `app-graph-builder.ts`, and items are created through a `CreateObjectEntry` that
calls `SpaceOperation.AddObject`, not `createSampleItem`. Settings render through the generic
`AppCapabilities.Settings` schema form, so there is no `SampleSettings` component. The deck companion
and `ActiveSpacePanel` show only the active space's name, not its SampleItems. No test covers the app
graph, the companions or settings persistence, and none of the scenarios runs end to end.

Of 37 items: 8 done, 15 untested, 3 partial, 4 diverged, 7 missing.

## Extensions

| Term      | URI                        |
| --------- | -------------------------- |
| `verdict` | `org.dxos.mdl.verdict@1.0` |

